~/arena/runs/ + analyze2.py; elec params registered 0.23 EUR/kWh x 600 W).
Deliverable: the square report of the tournament.

## Content

- Graphs from the arena data (reproducible script, not hand-drawn):
  quality/speed/cost scatter, the Pareto frontier, paired-diff
  distributions per hypothesis.
- Tables: the grid, the paired verdicts (H1/H2, effort axes, cross-camp),
  the 19 documented outcomes in their three classes.
- Cluster and class analysis (skills/route grid.json clusters; effort =
