- SITUATION CHOICE GUIDE: off-peak windows (DeepSeek time-of-use
  halves), quotas and caps (OR key cap stalls the whole judge panel —
  lesson recorded), latency/interaction needs, privacy/clearance
  (forces local), GPU state (local lane busy), budget.

